{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Faceball Captain is a football management-inspired roguelike deck builder. Sculpt your club to overpower your opponents and rise to the top of the Faceball pyramid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/BlinkingGIF.gif?t=1746544734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scout your players, hire your staff, and set them up to destroy your opponents. Earn enough money to improve your club, and keep your finances out of the red. Try to rise through the different leagues, but always remember - Going bankrupt or getting demoted is GAME OVER! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/GoalGIF.gif?t=1746544734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes tons of content with many strategies to discovers and loads of replayability.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ player abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ staff, each bending the rules of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 unique Captains, each adding pros and cons to your club</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 random callers, each with numerous ways to change the way your game is going</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/CallersGIF.gif?t=1746544734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Faceball Captain, the irreverent take on Football Management. Coming 2025!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690510?t=1746544734","background_raw":"htt